once, bounded queue) with a per-user rate limit.\n- Live sockets: sessions and access re-checked every 60 s (sign-out, expired/revoked link, role change);\n  non-owners cannot seed while a section is locked; document size capped (1 MB); per-connection message\n  budget; connection/room caps; read-only roles refused first; room lease table so a second API instance\n  refuses a room another instance owns (new migration resume_collab_leases).\n\nFollow-ups\n- Viewers see names, not emails or account ids (comments, history, document, presence); `mine` flag on comments.\n- UUID validation on every id; production Prisma errors no longer name columns; 413/400 for bad bodies.\n- Share token travels in X-Share-Token and is redacted from request and error logs.\n- Caps and pruning for versions, activity, comments, collaborators; batched activity writes; restore in a\n  transaction; cursor pagination for comments and shared-with-me.\n- PDF render queue cap, per-user render/export limits, 2 MB body limit on rendering/collaboration routes.\n- Persistence every 3 s, bounded lock cache, batched role re-checks, cached handshake lookups, merged presence.\n- Unused variable fix in resume.util; tests for all of the above; docs and .env.example updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-13T14:31:53-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/d830b86f2276a4a83d608c3b9aa7a550795201e9","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-13T14:31:53-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-13T14:31:53-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261113300000_resume_collab_leases/migration.sql","src/collaboration/comment.service.spec.ts","src/collaboration/resume-history.service.spec.ts","src/collaboration/resume-projections.spec.ts","src/collaboration/resu